{'symbol': 'DOW', 'date': '2022-05-04 09:00:00', 'title': "DOW ADVANCES TO #15 ON DIVERSITYINC'S 2022 TOP 50 COMPANIES FOR DIVERSITY LIST", 'text': "5TH CONSECUTIVE YEAR RECOGNIZED FOR MANAGEMENT OF INCLUSION, DIVERSITY AND EQUITY DOW ALSO EARNED A SPOT ON SIX SPECIALTY LISTS MIDLAND, MICH. , MAY 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DOW (NYSE: DOW) ADVANCED TO 15TH PLACE ON THE 2022 DIVERSITYINC TOP 50 COMPANIES FOR DIVERSITY LIST, WHICH WAS ANNOUNCED YESTERDAY AT DIVERSITYINC'S CELEBRATORY EVENT IN NEW YORK CITY."}